OL,3,GNEWSAFormer sports centre to be turned
OL,4,Ainto 31 flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former sports centre is be demolished
OL,7,Fand turned into 31 flats after plans to
OL,8,Ftransform the site were approved.
OL,10,FBuilt in the 1930s, the Arethusa
OL,11,FVenture Centre in Lower Upnor, Kent,
OL,12,Fwas most recently used for climbing,
OL,13,Fkayaking, sailing and paddleboarding
OL,14,Fprior to its closure in 2019.
OL,16,FLast week, Medway Council's planning
OL,17,Fcommittee granted an application, first
OL,18,Fsubmitted in December 2024, to turn it
OL,19,Finto two buildings of four and five
OL,20,Fstoreys.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
